{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152","id":1528007946,"node_id":"I_kwDOCX47u85bE40K","number":1152,"title":"`compare_server_default` parses `(getdate())` incorrectly","user":{"login":"GeorgeSchneelochVA","id":121249507,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzoe4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121249507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA","html_url":"https://github.com/GeorgeSchneelochVA","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GeorgeSchneelochVA/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1141241826,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQxODI2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1141242873,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjQyODcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/autogenerate%20-%20detection","name":"autogenerate - detection","color":"301030","default":false,"description":null},{"id":1831233351,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxODMxMjMzMzUx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"e87743","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2023-01-10T21:05:28Z","updated_at":"2023-01-11T14:30:29Z","closed_at":"2023-01-11T14:17:07Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nIn our MS SQL Server database we have a default constraint which is `(getdate())` for a column. For some reason `flask db migrate` was detecting a change even though our `server_default` value in our SQLAlchemy model was also `(getdate())`. I inspected it with pdb.set_trace() and found that `compare_server_default` is converting `(getdate())` to `getdate(`.\r\n\r\nIt looks like [this commit](https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/commit/26f8752a6c34c849221fa3c8c686ff67cd68e328#diff-bf4ade604361c4cb2ed0d3463fd87bff24d2456a42ee88e0e14e44c8a726430aR243) introduced the bug. In particular, there are slightly different regular expressions being used to clean `inspector_column` and `metadata_column`, which is why the comparison for this particular string was false.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n`compare_server_default` should clean the expression appropriately for both the metadata and inspector defaults, and compare\r\nthe cleaned values with each other.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n - Create a model with one datetime column with `server_default`=`(getdate())`\r\n - Create a corresponding table with the same column and the same default constraint \r\n - Run `flask db migrate`. You should not see any difference in schema, but since the comparison fails there will be a migration script created.\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: Windows Server 2019\r\n - Python: 3.8\r\n - Alembic: 1.9.1\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.4.39\r\n - Database: SQL Server 2019\r\n - DBAPI: \r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1152/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}